{"product_id":"when-churchill-slaughtered-sheep-and-stalin-robbed-a-bank-historys-unknown-chapters","title":"When Churchill Slaughtered Sheep and Stalin Robbed a Bank: History's Unknown Chapters","description":"\u003cp\u003eMore addictive and mind-blowing true tales from history, told by Giles Milton―one of today’s most entertaining and accessible yet always intelligent and illuminating historiansIn When Churchill Slaughtered Sheep and Stalin Robbed a Bank, the second installment in his outrageously entertaining series, History’s Unknown Chapters, Giles Milton shows his customary historical flair as he delves into the little-known stories from history, like when Stalin was actually assassinated with poison by one of his inner circle; the Russian scientist, dubbed the “Red Frankenstein,” who attempted to produce a human-ape hybrid through ethically dubious means; the family who survived thirty-eight days at sea with almost no water or supplies after their ship was destroyed by a killer whale; or the plot that served as a template for 9\/11 in which four Algerian terrorists attempted to hijack a plane and fly it into the Eiffel Tower.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 142 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Milton Giles\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781250078759\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790857035929,"sku":"17RA-19781250078759","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68edefeca0f37_When_Churchill_Slaughtered_Sheep_and_Stalin_Robbed_a_Bank-_History_s_Unknown_Chapters_Milton_Giles.jpg?v=1760460634","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/when-churchill-slaughtered-sheep-and-stalin-robbed-a-bank-historys-unknown-chapters","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}